{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-159",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "One circle split into five equal sectors, with the two right-hand sectors distinguished from the three remaining sectors to explain complementary fractions.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/5m/figures/fig-159.png",
      "sha256": "52bdacb04dd77efd0525bc88a25ad06dfe21890682c46e5b2aaeeea852031827",
      "width": 402,
      "height": 402
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "text": "如果从一个整圆中剪下圆的$\\frac{2}{5}$（图159），就剩下圆的$\\frac{3}{5}$. 圆的$\\frac{2}{5}$和圆的$\\frac{3}{5}$加在一起构成一个整圆，就是分数$\\frac{2}{5}$与$\\frac{3}{5}$的和等于1. 分数$\\frac{2}{5}$和$\\frac{3}{5}$互补成1. 为了求出一个分数的补数，必须从1中减去这个分数，例如：\n$1-\\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{5}{5}-\\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{3}{5}$，\n$1-\\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{5}{5}-\\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{2}{5}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "989",
        "text": "989. 把1化成下列分母的分数：2，3，11，20."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "990",
        "text": "990. 求差并验算：\n1) $1-\\frac{3}{4}$；\n2) $1-\\frac{2}{7}$；\n3) $1-\\frac{1}{6}$；\n4) $1-\\frac{8}{9}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "991",
        "text": "991. 求出下列分数的补数：\n1) $\\frac{5}{11}$；\n2) $\\frac{7}{13}$；\n3) $\\frac{7}{40}$；\n4) 0.01."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "992",
        "text": "992. 求出下列各式的值：\n1) $\\left(1-\\frac{5}{8}\\right)\\cdot\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$；\n2) $\\left(1-\\frac{7}{12}\\right):\\left(1-\\frac{3}{8}\\right)$；\n3) $1-\\left(\\frac{3}{5}+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)$；\n4) $\\frac{1}{4}-\\left(1-\\frac{5}{12}\\right)$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "993",
        "text": "993. 求下列各式的值：\n1) $-1+\\frac{3}{4}$；\n2) $1-\\frac{4}{11}$；\n3) $-1-\\frac{2}{5}$；\n4) $-1+\\frac{9}{10}$；\n5) $\\frac{3}{5}-1$；\n6) $\\frac{8}{17}-1$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "994",
        "text": "994. 解方程：\n1) $1-x=\\frac{3}{10}+\\frac{1}{15}$；\n2) $y-1=\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{6}{7}$；\n3) $x+1=\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot\\frac{3}{8}$；\n4) $1+y=\\frac{5}{12}:\\frac{5}{2}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "995",
        "text": "995. 学校游泳池通过第一条管道灌水要用4小时，通过第二条管道灌水要用6小时. 同时用两条管道灌水1小时后，游泳池还有几分之几要灌水？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "996",
        "text": "996. 新式挖沟机可用8小时挖一条沟，而旧式挖沟机要用12小时. 新式挖沟机工作3小时，旧式挖沟机工作5小时以后，这条沟还剩几分之几？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "997",
        "text": "997. 计算：\n1) $\\frac{3}{4}-\\frac{5}{6}$；\n2) $-\\frac{3}{10}-\\frac{5}{10}$；\n3) $\\frac{9}{20}+\\frac{3}{8}$；\n4) $\\frac{19}{75}-\\frac{11}{50}$；\n5) $\\frac{17}{20}-\\frac{13}{30}$；\n6) $\\frac{11}{14}+\\frac{8}{21}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "998",
        "text": "998. 作三角形$ABC$，角$C$是直角. 作三角形$ABC$的关于直线$AB$的对称三角形$AMB$和三角形$AMB$的关于$M$点的对称三角形$KMP$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "999",
        "text": "999. 解应用题：\n1) 联合收割机手收割了面积为230公顷的谷物，超额完成计划15%. 联合收割机手按计划应该收割多少公顷谷物？\n2) 一个木工组修缮房屋用了4.2立方米木板，节约了16%的木板. 拨给修缮房屋用的木板有多少立方米？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "1000",
        "text": "1000. 求差，然后用加法验算：\n1) $1-\\frac{10}{11}$；\n2) $1-\\frac{7}{15}$；\n3) $1-\\frac{8}{15}$；\n4) $1-\\frac{9}{20}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "1001",
        "text": "1001. 求下列各式的值：\n1) $-1-\\frac{8}{13}$；\n2) $-1+\\frac{6}{25}$；\n3) $\\frac{9}{40}-1$；\n4) $-1+\\frac{1}{30}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "1002",
        "text": "1002. 解方程：\n1) $1-k=\\frac{3}{5}+\\frac{1}{10}$；\n2) $t+1=\\frac{4}{9}\\cdot\\frac{3}{2}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "1003",
        "text": "1003. 一个拖拉机手耕了一块地的$\\frac{2}{9}$，另一个拖拉机手耕了同一块地的$\\frac{2}{3}$. 这块地还剩下几分之几没有耕？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "1004",
        "text": "1004. 汽油桶里的汽油够一辆汽车用7小时，而另一辆汽车可用5小时. 在第一辆汽车用2小时，第二辆汽车用3小时以后，油桶里剩下的油还有几分之几？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n52",
        "exercise": "1005",
        "text": "1005. 计算：\n1) $-4.8\\cdot3.7-2.9\\cdot8.7-2.6\\cdot5.3+6.2\\cdot1.9$；\n2) $-14.31:5.3-27.81:2.7+2.565:3.42+4.1\\cdot0.8$."
      }
    ],
